ng><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t3-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> to hair strand</p><p>c) shaft – not <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t3-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":8},{"id":"en-official-guide-t3-l-g4-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 39-40","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the summary below.</p><p>Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.</p><p class=\"source-transcript-subhead\"><strong>Health and Hair</strong></p><p>Changes in diet will take longer to affect your hair than your <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t3-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> . Vitamins C, D and E are all important for healthy hair and <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t3-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> are one of the best sources of Vitamin C.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":2}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/official_cambridge_guide_to_ielts_academic_listening_test_3_4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"qu